            Never miss an event! Subscribe to our calendar and get notifications about upcoming activities.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="text-left">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-4">Get Event Notifications</h3>
